{"title":"The Rebel Of The Tyrant Noble Family","synopsis":"Ash mengabdikan seluruh hidupnya kepada ayah angkatnya, bertekad membalas budi karena telah diterima dan dibesarkan sebagai seorang yatim piatu.\n\nNamun, kebenaran yang ia ketahui tepat di ambang kematian ternyata sama sekali berbeda.\n\nSemua usaha yang telah ia bangun…\n\nSemua kepercayaan yang telah ia berikan…\n\nBahkan kekuatan terhebat yang sejak awal terlahir bersamanya —Seven Wings—\n\nSemuanya telah dirampas darinya…!\n\nKalau begitu…\n\nAkankah kita memulai kehidupan pembalasan dan pembalikan takdir?","alternative_title":"暴君名家の反逆者-Aster-","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"f9665949-fc11-4839-b309-7e3d361d61df","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"ff330372-a8c8-4c54-96b5-7bc66ae9d9e9","number":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"0a769328-e5bd-4c29-816e-2faaf686172a","number":"31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"id":"e5672990-4121-4b34-ba54-bb1e9df2febd","number":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"id":"e12a600c-0891-4057-bb39-25bbb276a981","number":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"7dbf26b0-16c3-440d-aac1-11bd40e478b9","number":"28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"37918886-a349-43ba-8493-5332a1607cca","number":"27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"id":"5b9f3ccb-5949-40f9-bd92-b07b1f05311f","number":"26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"125bc20d-8fa5-4b41-aad9-34287a56eeeb","number":"25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"id":"05776617-e79c-4347-9ca6-706099495b14","number":"24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"id":"00f6ae4a-92c2-42d6-aa75-b241038c0ff9","number":"23","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"64978f4b-3192-4538-ad07-94da97aea052","number":"22","title":"C